    {
      "heading": "题目描述",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p>给定一个等差数列 <span class=\"katex math inline\">a_i</span> 的首项，第二项，末项，求和。</p>\n</div>            </div>",
      "text": "给定一个等差数列 a_i 的首项，第二项，末项，求和。"
    },
    {
      "heading": "输入",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p>输入三个数，分别为等差数列的首项，第二项和末项。</p>\n</div>            </div>",
      "text": "输入三个数，分别为等差数列的首项，第二项和末项。"
    },
    {
      "heading": "输出",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p>如果该等差数列只有三项，输出 <span class=\"katex math inline\"> a_1 + a_2 + a_3 = s</span> 。</p>\n<p>超过三项只显示前两项和最后一项，中间用 ... 省略。</p>\n<p>等号左侧的加数如果是负数要加()。</p>\n</div>            </div>",
      "text": "如果该等差数列只有三项，输出  a_1 + a_2 + a_3 = s 。\n超过三项只显示前两项和最后一项，中间用 ... 省略。\n等号左侧的加数如果是负数要加()。"
    },
    {
      "heading": "样例",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"sample-test\">\n                        <div class=\"input\">\n                            <h4>输入</h4>\n                            <pre>1 2 3</pre>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"output\">\n                            <h4>输出</h4>\n                            <pre>1+2+3=6</pre>\n                        </div>\n\n                                                    <div class=\"input\">\n                                <h4>输入</h4>\n                                <pre>-3 -2 0</pre>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"output\">\n                                <h4>输出</h4>\n                                <pre>(-3)+(-2)+...+0=-6</pre>\n                            </div>\n                        \n                                            </div>\n                </div>",
      "text": "输入\n                            1 2 3\n                        \n                        \n                            输出\n                            1+2+3=6\n                        \n\n                                                    \n                                输入\n                                -3 -2 0\n                            \n                            \n                                输出\n                                (-3)+(-2)+...+0=-6"
    },
    {
      "heading": "说明",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"markdown\"><p>【数据范围】</p>\n<p><span class=\"katex math inline\">-10^5 \\leq a_i \\leq 10^5</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"katex math inline\">3 \\leq </span> 等差数列的项数<span class=\"katex math inline\">n</span> <span class=\"katex math inline\">\\leq 10^4</span></p>\n</div>\n\n                    \n                </div>",
